\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. In heavenly love abiding,
\par No change my heart shall fear;
\par And safe is such confiding,
\par For nothing changes here:
\par The storm may roar without me,
\par My heart may low be laid;
\par But God is round about me,
\par And can I be dismayed?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Wherever He may guide me,
\par No want shall turn me back;
\par My Shepherd is beside me,
\par And nothing can I lack:
\par His wisdom ever waketh,
\par His sight is never dim;
\par He knows the way He taketh,
\par And I will walk with Him.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Green pastures are before me,
\par Which yet I have not seen;
\par Bright skies will soon be o'er me,
\par Where the dark clouds have been:
\par My hope I cannot measure,
\par My path to life is free;
\par My Saviou has my treasure,
\par And He will walk with me.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

